{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011ChACtxegv5gGipCBWxveL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```python\nfrom datetime import datetime\n\ndef days_between(date1: str, date2: str, fmt: str = \"%Y-%m-%d\") -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    計算兩個日期字串相差的天數（取絕對值）。\n\n    :param date1: 第一個日期字串，例如 \"2026-11-18\"\n    :param date2: 第二個日期字串，例如 \"2026-12-25\"\n    :param fmt:   日期格式，預設為 \"%Y-%m-%d\"\n    :return:      相差的天數\n    \"\"\"\n    d1 = datetime.strptime(date1, fmt).date()\n    d2 = datetime.strptime(date2, fmt).date()\n    return abs((d2 - d1).days)\n\n\n# 使用範例\nprint(days_between(\"2026-11-18\", \"2026-12-25\"))             # 37\nprint(days_between(\"2026/01/01\", \"2025/01/01\", \"%Y/%m/%d\"))  # 365\n```\n\n**說明：**\n- 用 `datetime.strptime` 把字串轉成日期，再把兩個日期相減，得到 `timedelta`，`.days` 就是相差天數。\n- 用 `abs()` 取絕對值，所以兩個日期的先後順序不影響結果。如果要知道先後（有正負號），把 `abs()` 拿掉即可。\n- 日期格式不同時，可以從 `fmt` 參數傳入，例如 `\"%Y/%m/%d\"`、`\"%d-%m-%Y\"`。\n- 日期格式不符或日期不存在（例如 `2026-02-30`）時，會拋出 `ValueError`。"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5583,"cache_read_input_tokens":29283,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5583},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9e3e7a2f-d1eb-44e5-b105-4b2d3703ab45","uuid":"14dfa24e-65e8-4497-a023-d7e711fbfa52","timestamp":"2026-11-18T10:05:46.797Z","request_id":"req_011ChACtxTHFNvT7uZwcQYVU"}
